Bug 2077964 - Read OPML fz:quickMode and fz:options by namespace on import. r=edicharry

importOPMLOutlines looked the attributes up by their literal "fz:" qualified
names, so an OPML file binding urn:forumzilla: to any other prefix lost its
settings and got the account defaults instead. A feed exported as paused would
then be re-enabled and fetched. Use getAttributeNS with FeedUtils.FZ_NS.

Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332434

